# Fastlane
/.env
/fastlane/report.xml
/fastlane/README.md
# Decrypted service-account JSON must never land on disk — catch-all in case
# something accidentally writes it. The encrypted .gpg form stays tracked.
/fastlane/*.json
!/fastlane/*.json.gpg
